@0  = ~I see you've already helped yourself to the item that I am here to grant you.~
@1  = ~My tree is thirsty. Bring me water. Then I will give you what you need from this place.~
@2  = ~You come bearing a gift for my tree.~
@3  = ~As promised, I will gift you what I have in my possession.~
@4  = ~My presence here is no longer needed.~
@5  = ~You went to so many places to get water for my tree. Your efforts are appreciated.~
@6  = ~What is this place?~
@7  = ~What do you mean by "what I need from this place"?~
@8  = ~Where would I find water here?~
@9  = ~How about I just take whatever you are hiding?~
@10 = ~I'll be going.~
@11 = ~It is serving a purpose you will understand in time.~
@12 = ~Is anything in here real?~
@13 = ~It is as real as it has to be.~
@14 = ~The item you need to be able to see.~
@15 = ~You have already crossed several places on your way here.~
@16 = ~What do I need to find here?~
@17 = ~Your actions will be weighed. Do what your heart tells you.~
@18 = ~I will be here for as long as I am needed.~
